{
  "_comment": [
    "Place this file at .claude/settings.json in your project root, and copy the hooks/",
    "folder from this repo to .claude/hooks/. Three PreToolUse hooks fire on `git commit`:",
    "  1. build gate         - your stack's cheapest compile/collect check (replace <build-command>)",
    "  2. staged-secrets     - denies a commit whose STAGED files carry a live provider key",
    "  3. conflict-markers   - denies a commit whose STAGED files carry <<<<<<< ======= >>>>>>>",
    "Both guards read only the index, fail OPEN on any error, and have an escape token.",
    "See docs/HOOKS.md and docs/PRE_COMMIT_BUILD_GATE.md.",
    "",
    "POSIX (macOS, Linux, Git Bash on Windows): the .sh lines below work as written.",
    "Windows with PowerShell as the hook shell: swap each guard command for",
    "  \"shell\": \"powershell\",",
    "  \"command\": \"pwsh -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File \\\"${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR}/.claude/hooks/guard-staged-secrets.ps1\\\"\"",
    "(use `powershell` instead of `pwsh` on Windows PowerShell 5.1). The build gate becomes",
    "  \"command\": \"Set-Location $env:CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR; <build-command> *> $null; if (-not $?) { '{\\\"hookSpecificOutput\\\":{\\\"hookEventName\\\":\\\"PreToolUse\\\",\\\"permissionDecision\\\":\\\"deny\\\",\\\"permissionDecisionReason\\\":\\\"Build failed.\\\"}}' }\"",
    "",
    "Build command per stack: next build --no-lint | tsc --noEmit | cargo check | go build ./... | python -m pytest --collect-only -q"
  ],
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "if": "Bash(git commit *)",
            "command": "cd \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR\" && <build-command> > /dev/null 2>&1 || echo '{\"hookSpecificOutput\":{\"hookEventName\":\"PreToolUse\",\"permissionDecision\":\"deny\",\"permissionDecisionReason\":\"Build failed. Fix the build before committing.\"}}'",
            "timeout": 180,
            "statusMessage": "Build check before commit..."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "if": "Bash(git commit *)",
            "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/guard-staged-secrets.sh\"",
            "timeout": 30,
            "statusMessage": "Checking staged files for credentials"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "if": "Bash(git commit *)",
            "command": "bash \"$CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR/.claude/hooks/guard-conflict-markers.sh\"",
            "timeout": 30,
            "statusMessage": "Checking for merge-conflict markers"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
